# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts: a required place must be compatible): the root head Q of D is a Structure,
# the Q of S an int, so the place does not fit. The admission fails when the program runs, before S runs: the
# implicit call throw, taken by catch: call; D\x keeps 1. Entry 7.
S:
    int: x 9
    int: Q 2
end: S
D:
    int: x 1
    Q:
        int: v 3
    end: Q
end: D
fn: run () int
    int: r 82
    call: S D
    catch: call ()
        r: 83
        if: D\x = 1 && D\Q\v = 3
            r: 7
    ---
return: r
int: got run()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
